1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,300
An example became a product limit.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,440
For early feedback,

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,780
let’s keep the first user story’s scope small:

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,600
tag a few contacts, say three.

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,400
I’ll ask the agent

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,520
to enforce a maximum of three.

7
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,380
Why can’t I tag four?

8
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,340
Three was our example.

9
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,500
We never agreed a maximum.

10
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,020
Clarify what this story must deliver—

11
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,040
and what the product must reject.

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,420
With people and AI.
